1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,410
Did the woman get what she wanted?
这位夫人买到她想要的东西了吗？

2
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:15,980
Did the woman get what she wanted?
这位夫人买到她想要的东西了吗？

3
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,750
A woman in jeans stood at the window of an expensive shop.
一位穿着牛仔裤的妇女站在一家高档商店的橱窗前。

4
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,310
Though she hesitated for a moment,
虽然她犹豫了一会儿，

5
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:30,850
she finally went in and asked to see a dress that was in the window.
但最后还是走了进去，要求看看橱窗里的那件连衣裙。

6
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:36,830
The assistant who served her did not like the way she was dressed.
接待她的售货员不喜欢她的穿着。

7
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:43,250
Glancing at her scornfully, he told her that the dress was sold.
他轻蔑地看了她一眼，告诉她那件衣服已经卖出去了。

8
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:51,670
The woman walked out of the shop angrily and decided to punish the assistant next day.
妇女生气地走出商店，决定第二天惩罚那个售货员。

9
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:58,730
She returned to the shop the following morning dressed in a fur coat,
第二天上午，她穿着一件裘皮大衣又来到这家商店，

10
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:03,060
with a handbag in one hand and a long umbrella in the other.
一只手拎着手提包，另一只手拿着一把长伞。

11
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:07,710
After seeking out the rude assistant,
她找到那个无礼的售货员后，

12
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,130
she asked for the same dress.
要了同一件连衣裙。

13
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,430
Not realizing who she was,
售货员没认出她是谁，

14
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:16,430
the assistant was eager to serve her this time.
这次很乐意接待她。

15
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:22,910
With great difficulty, he climbed into the shop window to get the dress.
他费了很大劲爬进橱窗去取那件衣服。

16
00:01:24,550 --> 00:01:26,240
As soon as she saw it,
她一看到衣服，

17
00:01:26,330 --> 00:01:28,460
the woman said she did not like it.
就说她不喜欢。

18
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:34,550
She enjoyed herself making the assistant bring almost everything in the window
她开心地支使售货员把橱窗里几乎每件东西都拿来，

19
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:38,910
before finally buying the dress she had first asked for.
最后才买下她最初要的那件连衣裙。
